舟，桃源一起愁。千陇导因业，赤土大地愁”）。\n\nsummary:\n夜色月下，女子坐在石栏旁面向镜头深情演唱，眼神带有些许忧郁与坚定。\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>：1:1保留参考图的面容、白衣红带汉服及红花发饰造型。\n\n<Audio 1>：1:1复用为该段音频轨道，人物口型与歌词完全精准同步。\n\ndetailed_description:\n古风夜景，冷月高悬，古朴楼阁与夜风微动。\n\n[Shot 1] 中景。夜幕下，<Subject 1>坐在露台石栏上，月光洒在白衣上。她微抬头面朝镜头，随《<Audio 1>》演唱“烽烟照焦舟，桃源一起愁”，口型与歌词严格同步，夜风吹拂红发带。\n\n[Shot 2] （00:05.000起）特写。镜头缓推至<Subject 1>面部，她继续准确演唱“千陇导因业，赤土大地愁”，口型自然，表情流露悲悯。\n\noverall_soundscape:\n夜风拂过古楼与长裙的轻微声响。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n直接复用 <Audio 1>。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-656.2664184570312, 6418.8515625], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "ds": {"offset": [1806.6294813011787, -5046.857637261862], "scale": 0.4500000000000009}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "工作区", "bounding": [-1617.6673583984375, 5270.58251953125, 2442.423583984375, 744.80224609375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "输入区", "bounding": [-666.2664184570312, 6050.7763671875, 808.6580810546875, 830.6287841796875]}], "links": [[251, 119, 0, 122, 1, "VAE"], [273, 119, 0, 136, 1, "VAE"], [274, 120, 0, 136, 2, "VAE"], [276, 115, 0, 136, 10, "INT"], [277, 115, 1, 136, 11, "INT"], [278, 137, 0, 136, 3, "IMAGE"], [279, 138, 0, 136, 9, "STRING"], [283, 141, 0, 142, 0, "AUDIO"], [284, 142, 0, 136, 7, "AUDIO"], [309, 142, 0, 153, 0, "AUDIO"], [324, 156, 0, 157, 0, "MODEL"], [325, 128, 0, 1